% expect-output: true
% expect-output: 0
% expect-output: 2
% expect-output: false
% expect-output: true
% expect-output: 0
% expect-output: 0
% Scenario: the resident set is reported. resourcestatus reports a
% standard font as resident (status 2) and an alias name as absent,
% since substitution is findfont's behaviour alone; a font the job
% defines has status 0.
% Expect: true 0 2, false, then true 0 0.
/Helvetica /Font resourcestatus = = =
/Arial /Font resourcestatus =
/Helvetica findfont /Mine exch definefont pop
/Mine /Font resourcestatus = = =
